'''Cavern grubs''' are obtained from opening [[Chest (Chambers of Xeric)|chests]] in the [[creature keeper]]'s room within the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. They are used to feed the [[corrupted scavenger]], done so by placing them within the [[trough (Chambers of Xeric)|trough]]. Cavern grubs are stackable, but players may only have up to 28 at a time.

